[{"ave_id":"AVE-2007-0004","file_name":"2007/AVE-2007-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2007-4504","title":"Joomla! RSfiles 1.0.2 路径遍历文件下载漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 RSfiles 组件 1.0.2 版本中存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者通过在请求中构造恶意的 path 参数，可利用目录遍历技术下载服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 Joomla! 及 RSfiles 组件的所有 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2007-4504"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2007-08-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2007-08-24T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 RSfiles 组件至 1.0.2 以上版本，厂商 RSJoomla 已在后续版本中修复 `path` 参数路径遍历漏洞。如无法获取更新，建议彻底卸载 `com_rsfiles` 组件并换用其他文件管理扩展。临时缓解措施：在 Joomla! 根目录 .htaccess 中添加重写规则，拦截 `option=com_rsfiles&task=files.display` 请求中 path 参数包含 `..` 或 `|` 的恶意请求；同时在 PHP 层面过滤 `$_GET['path']` 中的目录遍历序列，禁止包含 `..` 的输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/4307","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2007/CVE-2007-4504.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2007/CVE-2007-4504.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/69a5a3cf926251a00061ec14d208b227367df73d/http/cves/2007/CVE-2007-4504.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8aea42c71147e21c6d32b71ffce877107de995c6/cves/2007/4xxx/CVE-2007-4504.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2007-4504-1339.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2007-4504-1342.yaml","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/nuclei/nuclei.txt","https://github.com/ahisec/Lots-of-POC/blob/51ed84ccc21e97e5e12563150992e03f9de384cd/nuclei/joomla/rsfiles/CVE-2007-4504.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2007-4504-1340.yaml","ht