/BrowseProject.jspa 页面中。远程攻击者可通过向 id 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码实施攻击，当管理员或其他用户访问被篡改的页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露（如 Session Cookie 窃取）或页面内容篡改。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制 URL 即可触发。Atlassian 已发布修复版本，建议升级至 3.7.4 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2007-0885"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2007-02-12T20:28:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:36:28Z","remediation":"立即从 JIRA 服务器中移除或禁用 Rainbow.Zen 扩展，以消除通过 `id` 参数注入脚本的攻击面。如仍需类似功能，替换为官方受支持的 JIRA 插件。在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 `/jira/secure/BrowseProject.jspa` 的 `id` 参数进行输入过滤，拦截 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等 XSS 载荷。如果无法移除该扩展，修改源码对 `id` 参数做严格的 HTML 实体编码输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/33683","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/459590/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/22503","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/32418","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/29576","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2007/CVE-2007-0885.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2007/CVE-2007-0885.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/69a5a3cf926251a00061ec14d208b227367df73d/http/cves/2007/CVE-2007-0885.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8aea42c71147e21c6d32b71ffce877107de995c6/cves/2007/0xxx/CVE-2007-0885.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2007-0885_%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2007-0885-1336.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2007-0885-1332.yaml","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2007/CVE-2007-0885.json","https://github.com/VladimirFilipovic/nuclei-templates-test/blob/e99d7d6b2401fbe93b3734a8fc86d682b4269328/http/cves/2007/CVE-2007-0885.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2007/CVE-2007-0885","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2007-0885_4.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2007/AVE-2007-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2007-0007","file_name":"2007/AVE-2007-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2007-0671","title":"Microsoft Excel 未指明远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 存在远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者通过诱导用户打开特制的 Excel 文件即可触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Excel 2000、XP、2003 及 2004 for Mac 等多个版本，已被用于定向零日攻击。攻击需要用户交互配合，但无需额外身份认证，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2007-0671"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2007-02-03T01:28:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:36:02Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS07-015 提供的更新（KB932553），该补丁通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从微软官网下载安装。对于 Excel 2000/XP/2003 及 Office 2004 for Mac 用户，安装此更新可彻底修复该远程代码执行漏洞。临时缓解措施：不要打开不可信的 Excel 附件，在邮件网关层面拦截带有 .xls 附件的可疑邮件。Office 2000 等已停止支持版本建议升级到受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/31901","http://secunia.com/advisories/24008","http://securitytracker.com/id?1017584","http://vil.nai.com/vil/content/v_141393.htm","http://www.avertlabs.com/research/blog/?p=191","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/613740","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/932553.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/22383","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA07-044A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2007/0463","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2007/ms07-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/32178","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A301","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2007/ms07-